  "question": {
    "text": "Consider<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "84",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Multiplying the numerator and denominator by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;in the given integral, we get,</p><p><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now substitute <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br />As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn></math></p>",
